acingsate = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/time) (w:those who have completed/those who have reached) (d:<a> and <cingsate> written as one word: those who have already completed a set number of days or years) (j:a/cingsate) (r:zd:24450) (q:draft)
acitak = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social) (w:honest/faithful/trustworthy) (d:<a> and <citak> written as one word: who is honest, the honest one) (j:a/citak) (r:zd:19506/zd:19595/zd:11251) (q:draft)
acitawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:media/social) (w:some saying) (d:<a>, <ci> and <tawh> written as one word: with those who say so; placed after each of several quoted opinions, some saying this and some saying that) (j:a/ci/tawh) (r:zd:14885/zd:21369/zd:15727) (q:draft)
acite = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:those who say) (d:<a> and <cite> written as one word: the people who say something, placed after the words spoken) (j:a/cite) (r:zd:24068/zd:23571) (q:draft)
acizong = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday/media) (w:some also say) (d:<a>, <ci>, say, and <zong>, also, written as one word: one who says so also, used before <om> to report a different account: there are also those who say) (j:a/ci/zong) (r:zd:19631/zd:12915) (q:draft)
