active = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social/everyday) (w:active) (d:taking part and doing much, the English word; {active member} is a member who takes part) (o:English) (r:zd:25469/zd:25584/zd:23535) (q:draft, low confidence)
activity = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:activity/event) (d:something that a group or family arranges and does together) (o:English) (r:zd:21761) (q:draft, low confidence)
