adal = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/politics) (w:protect/shield/defend) (d:<a> and <dal> written as one word: shield or defend it, or the one who shields; often in the pairs {ahung adal} and {akem adal}) (j:a/dal) (r:zd:11598/ts:617) (q:draft)
adal = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/home) (w:layer/sheet/curtain) (d:<a> and <dal> written as one word: a sheet or layer of something, a covering or a curtain) (j:a/dal) (r:zd:16929/zd:23853) (q:draft, low confidence)
