aizong = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:however/but/even so) (d:spoken form of {ahi zong}, though it is so: however, but, placed at the beginning of a sentence; repeated after two words it means whether the one or the other) (r:zd:17760/zd:23086/zd:26097) (q:draft)
Ajil = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (f:politics/travel) (w:Ajil) (d:place in Hulu Terengganu, Malaysia, known for its immigration detention centre) (r:zd:15356/zd:15165) (q:draft)
ak = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (f:nature/food) (w:chicken/fowl/rooster) (d:the domestic fowl, a chicken; {ak a khuang} is the rooster crows) (s:aak/aklui) (q:draft)
