akaikhawm = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/social) (w:collector/gatherer/recruiter) (d:<a> and <kaikhawm> written as one word: one who gathers or collects things or money, or who recruits people) (j:a/kaikhawm) (r:zd:24068/zd:20505) (q:draft)
