akanciansan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:investigate/look into closely) (d:<a>, <kan>, inquire, and <cian>, clearly, with the ending {-san}, written as one word: he or they are looking closely into a matter; {akanciansan laitak} is the investigation is under way) (r:zd:20982/zd:13056) (q:draft)
akanding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:to investigate/to inquire into/to look for) (d:<a>, <kan> and <ding> written as one word: in order to look into a matter, cover news or search for a person) (j:a/kan/ding) (r:zd:14818/zd:20050) (q:draft)
