akawng = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body) (w:waist) (d:<a> and <kawng> written as one word: his or her waist; {akawng ah} is at or around the waist) (j:a/kawng) (r:zd:19644/zd:17913/zd:19428) (q:draft)
