akep = (i:1) (t:v) (f:family/everyday) (w:look after/keep/raise) (d:<a> and <kep> written as one word: he looks after, the one he keeps or brings up) (j:a/kep) (r:zd:16976/zd:20807/zd:14597) (q:draft)
