apua = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/home) (w:outside/the outside) (d:<a> and <pua>, outside, written as one word, mostly as {apua lam}, the outside, outdoors) (j:a/pua) (r:zd:22658/zd:24129/zd:23933) (q:draft)
