asawl = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:send/order) (d:<a> and <sawl> written as one word: he sent or ordered, the one who sends, what he orders) (j:a/sawl) (r:zd:25918/zd:14941) (q:draft)
asawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:intend/plan/try) (d:<a> and <sawm> written as one word, placed after a verb or noun: he or they intend, plan or try to do it; {atup asawm} is what one aims at and plans) (j:a/sawm) (r:zd:25919/zd:20300/zd:21321) (q:draft)
asawm = (i:2) (t:num) (f:everyday) (w:ten/tens) (d:<a> and <sawm>, ten, written as one word: the ten, by tens; with {-na} it forms the ordinals of the tens) (j:a/sawm) (r:zd:21904) (q:draft, low confidence)
asawt = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:time) (w:long/long-lasting/for a long time) (d:<a> and <sawt> written as one word: it lasts long, or what is long in time; {asawt lo in} is before long and {asawt ciangin} after a long time) (j:a/sawt) (r:zd:11714/zd:16820/zd:16216) (q:draft)
asawt loin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:soon/before long/shortly) (d:<asawt>, lasting long, and <loin>, without: before long, soon; stands before the clause, and after a clause with <zawh>, as in {atun zawh uh asawt loin}, means not long after) (r:zd:24333/zd:26097/zd:23556) (q:draft)
asawtlo = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:soon/before long/shortly) (d:<a>, <sawt>, long, and <lo>, not, written as one word, mostly followed by <in>: {asawtlo in} is not long after, soon) (j:a/sawt/lo) (r:zd:13138/zd:22167/zd:25589) (q:draft)
asawtnailo = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:recently/not long ago) (d:<a>, <sawt>, long, and <nailo>, not yet, written as one word: not long ago; also before <hun> as {asawtnailo hunsung}, in recent times) (j:a/sawt/nailo) (r:zd:12029/zd:19644/zd:12387) (q:draft)
