atel = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/education) (w:understand/one who understands) (d:<a> and <tel> written as one word: he or she understands, or the one who understands; {atel baih} is easy to understand) (j:a/tel) (r:zd:22833/zd:22557/zd:22922) (q:draft)
atel = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/politics) (w:choose/elect) (d:<a> and <teel> written as one word, with the vowel written short: he, she or they chose) (j:a/teel) (r:zd:24673/zd:15810) (q:draft, low confidence)
