athupiang = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/everyday) (w:what happened/the incident/the event) (d:<a> and <thupiang>, event, written as one word: the thing that happened, the facts of an incident; {athupiang teng} is all that happened) (j:a/thupiang) (r:zd:12277/zd:21057/zd:12707) (q:draft)
