athupitna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:importance/significance) (d:<a> and <thupitna> written as one word: its importance, the importance of what is named before it) (j:a/thupitna) (r:zd:13076/zd:15998) (q:draft)
athupizaw = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:more important/greater) (d:<a> and <thupizaw> written as one word: more important, the more important one) (j:a/thupizaw) (r:zd:21517/zd:14941) (q:draft)
