Australian = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:social) (w:Australian) (d:of Australia and its people; {Australian gammi} is an Australian citizen) (o:English) (r:zd:24042/zd:20416) (q:draft)
Austria = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Austria) (d:country in central Europe, with Vienna as its capital) (r:zd:17846/zd:11283) (q:draft)
Authorities = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:authorities) (d:the officials who hold power in a place, mostly as {Local Authorities te}, the local authorities) (s:thuneite) (o:English) (r:zd:16389/zd:19131/zd:17703) (q:draft)
automatic = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/it) (w:automatic/automatically) (d:working by itself; {automatic in} is automatically, of its own accord) (o:English) (r:zd:15274/zd:11130) (q:draft)
ava = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:go and) (d:<a> and <va> written as one word before a verb: he goes and does it, went there to do it) (j:a/va) (r:ts:3369/zd:12391) (q:draft)
avaan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/work) (w:take charge of/look after/handle) (d:<a> and <vaan> written as one word: takes charge of a matter or of people in need and sees to it; {avaan ding} is to take charge of it) (j:a/vaan) (r:zd:15473/zd:22159) (q:draft, low confidence)
