avaihawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/work) (w:organize/manage/plan) (d:<a> and <vaihawm> written as one word: he or they arrange it, or before a noun the one who arranges or is in charge, as {avaihawm pawl}, the organizing group) (j:a/vaihawm) (r:zd:16506/zd:22371/zd:18231) (q:draft)
