aveng = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/home) (w:neighbour/neighbourhood) (d:<a> and <veng> written as one word: his or their neighbours, the neighbourhood of the person spoken of; {aveng apam} is the people living all around) (j:a/veng) (r:zd:11020/zd:24029) (q:draft)
