average = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/work) (w:average) (d:the average of a set of numbers; {average in} is on average) (o:English) (r:zd:17666/zd:14564/zd:17618) (q:draft)
avom = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:black/the black one) (d:<a> and <vom> written as one word: it is black, or the black one) (j:a/vom) (r:zd:21605/zd:14581/zd:11373) (q:draft)
avot = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:nature/everyday) (w:cold/the cold) (d:<a> and <vot> written as one word: cold, or the cold as against {asa}, the heat; {avot alum} is cold and warmth, hard times and good) (j:a/vot) (r:zd:16823/zd:21826/zd:18872) (q:draft)
