aw = (i:3) (t:intj) (f:everyday) (w:yes) (d:answer of agreement to a question or an invitation) (s:awleh)
aw e = (i:1) (t:intj) (f:social/religion) (w:O/oh) (d:the vocative <aw.1> with the exclamation <e>: closes a line of a song, poem or prayer, after the one addressed as in {ka Pasian aw e}, O my God, or after a whole line as a cry of feeling) (r:zd:16038/zd:15772) (q:draft, low confidence)
