awlmawhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/everyday) (w:concern/care/interest/attention) (d:<awlmawh>, care about, with the noun suffix <na>: caring about a person or matter and giving it attention; {awlmawhna nei} is to care) (b:awlmawh) (r:zd:17772/zd:25078/zd:19622) (q:draft)
