azak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:hear) (d:<a> and <zak> written as one word: he or she hears, mostly before <ciangin>, when he heard; also what is heard, as in {azak nop}, pleasant to hear) (j:a/zak) (r:zd:17049/zd:19565/zd:24714) (q:draft)
