benefit = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/politics) (w:benefit/allowance) (d:money or help that a government or an employer gives to a person, as in {Unemployment benefit}, pay for those out of work) (o:English) (r:zd:25325/zd:25925) (q:draft)
