Checkup = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:checkup/medical examination) (d:an examination of the body by a doctor, often {Medical Checkup}; with <bawl>, do, have or give a checkup) (o:English) (r:zd:19788/zd:17112) (q:draft)
