Chennai = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:travel) (w:Chennai) (d:city in the south of India, capital of the state of Tamil Nadu) (r:ts:3506/zd:10812) (q:draft)
Cheras = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (f:travel) (w:Cheras) (d:district of Kuala Lumpur in Malaysia where many Zomi live) (o:Malay) (r:zd:17463/zd:14706) (q:draft)
chess = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:chess) (d:the board game chess; {chess kimawl} is play chess) (o:English) (r:zd:14952/zd:10746) (q:draft)
