fee = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:fee/charge) (d:money paid for a service or a permit, used after an English word as in {Visa fee} and {Entry fee}; the Zolai word is <man>) (o:English) (r:zd:19190/zd:14767) (q:draft, low confidence)
Feedback = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/it) (w:feedback/response) (d:what readers or users say in reply about a piece of writing or a service) (o:English) (r:zd:10892/zd:22457) (q:draft, low confidence)
feeling = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:feeling/emotion) (d:what a person feels, emotion as against fact or reason) (o:English) (r:zd:24149/zd:23025) (q:draft)
ferry = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:ferry/shuttle bus) (d:a ferry boat; in Myanmar usage also a bus that carries workers or students to and from their place) (o:English) (r:zd:16038/zd:15459) (q:draft, low confidence)
