Football = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/media) (w:football/soccer) (d:the game of football, played with a <bawlung>, ball; {football kimawlna} is the playing of football) (o:English) (r:zd:20145/zd:17776/zd:9266) (q:draft)
Foreigner = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/travel) (w:foreigner) (d:the English word, in the articles mostly set beside <gamdangmi> as a second name for the same thing) (s:gamdangmi) (o:English) (r:zd:12490/zd:17361) (q:draft)
form = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/education) (w:form/application form) (d:a printed paper with spaces to fill in, as for an application or a registration) (o:English) (r:zd:22888/zd:22714/zd:20859) (q:draft)
