gallon = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/everyday) (w:gallon) (d:measure for water, fuel and other liquids; it stands before the number, as {gallon khat}, one gallon) (o:English) (r:zd:16862/zd:25346/zd:16604) (q:draft)
