gambel = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:refugee/asylum seeker) (d:<gam>, country, with <bel>, take refuge in: a person who has fled to another country and shelters there; often {gambel mi}) (s:galtai) (r:zd:23528/zd:20119/zd:23317) (q:draft)
gambelmi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:refugee/asylum seeker) (d:a person who takes refuge in another country; <gambel> with <mi>, person) (s:galtai) (r:zd:21574) (q:draft)
