gambup kiteelpi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:general election/nationwide election) (d:<gambup>, the whole country, and <kiteelpi>, a great election: the general election of a country; the year often stands before it) (r:zd:23485/zd:24731) (q:draft)
gambup thukhunpi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:national constitution/constitution of the state) (d:<gambup>, the whole country, and <thukhunpi>, constitution: the constitution of a state, as against the constitution of an organisation; a year before or after it names one, {2008 gambup thukhunpi}) (r:zd:25110/zd:19697/zd:22475) (q:draft)
gamdangmi khualzin = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:foreign tourist/foreign visitor) (d:<gamdangmi>, foreigner, and <khualzin>, travel: a foreigner who travels in the country, a foreign tourist) (r:zd:17349/zd:11401) (q:draft)
gamdangmi nasem = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/politics) (w:foreign worker/migrant worker) (d:<gamdangmi>, foreigner, and <nasem>, worker: a person from another country who works in the land, the term of the news for migrant labour in Malaysia) (r:zd:13218/zd:14704) (q:draft)
