genvai tanupi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:welfare secretary/Genvai secretary) (d:<Genvai>, the mutual aid fund of a Zomi community association, and <tanupi>, secretary: the officer who keeps the fund and signs its notices of condolence) (r:zd:16813) (q:draft)
genvai tanute = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:mutual aid fund stewards/fund helpers) (d:{genvai}, the mutual aid fund of a community, and <tanute>, daughters, the name by custom of those appointed to serve at a household's occasions: the persons who serve a mutual aid fund, named in notices beside the members who have joined) (r:zd:24941) (q:draft, low confidence)
genvailut = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/work) (w:Genvai member/enrolled member) (d:a person who has joined, <lut>, the <Genvai>, the mutual fund of Zomi Innkuan USA that pays out at a death) (r:zd:25066) (q:draft, low confidence)
