Guardhouse = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/home) (w:guardhouse/guard post) (d:the small building at an entrance where security guards keep watch) (o:English) (r:zd:12325/zd:13272) (q:draft)
Guardian = (i:1) (t:name) (f:media) (w:The Guardian) (d:a British newspaper, mostly named as the source of a news report) (r:zd:23591) (q:draft)
Guasing = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:travel) (w:Guasing) (d:a village in Tedim township, Chin State) (r:zd:19293/zd:10689) (q:draft)
guatawn = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/nature) (w:bamboo pole/bamboo stick) (d:a length of bamboo used as a pole, for carrying, poking, or hanging clothes to dry) (r:zd:14917/zd:12387/zd:19428) (q:draft)
Guatemala = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics/travel) (w:Guatemala) (d:country in Central America) (r:zd:20023/zd:19985) (q:draft)
guhletang = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body/health) (w:bones/skeleton/frame) (d:<guh>, bone, <le>, and, and <tang> written as one word: the bones of the body as a whole, probably bones and joints) (r:zd:24276/zd:23443) (q:draft, low confidence)
guiawk = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/health) (w:hang/hang oneself) (d:die or kill by a rope round the neck, from <gui>, here rope, and <awk>, be caught; {ki guiawk} is hang oneself) (r:zd:16849/zd:10842) (q:draft)
guidelines = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/politics) (w:guidelines) (d:official advice on what to do; the articles gloss it as <thukhun>) (o:English) (r:zd:25180/zd:24691) (q:draft, low confidence)
guihtheih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:intoxicant/drug/alcohol) (d:<guih> and <theih> written as one word, what can make drunk: drink or drugs that intoxicate, mostly in the pair <guihtheih khamtheih>, drugs and alcohol) (s:khamtheih) (j:guih/theih) (r:zd:20064/zd:14767/zd:13320) (q:draft)
guihtheih khamtheih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:intoxicants/drugs and alcohol/narcotics) (d:<guihtheih>, what can make drunk, and <khamtheih>, what can intoxicate, two words of like meaning set side by side: intoxicants of every kind, drugs and strong drink; the usual term for narcotic drugs in news and in teaching) (r:zd:14791/zd:14620/zd:21529) (q:draft)
guitar = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/social) (w:guitar) (d:the musical instrument; {guitar tum} is play the guitar) (o:English) (r:zd:16442/zd:23036) (q:draft)
guksawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/media) (w:try to steal/attempt to abduct) (d:<guk>, here the form of <gu>, steal, and not the number six, with <sawm>, intend: try to steal a thing; of a person, try to abduct) (r:zd:15764/zd:14758/zd:14834) (q:draft)
gulh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:long for/desire) (d:the second part of <lunggulh>, long for, when the word is written as two, {lung gulh}; not seen by itself) (r:zd:11395/zd:24064) (q:draft)
Gullu = (i:1) (t:name) (c:mountain) (f:nature/politics) (w:Gullu Mual) (d:a mountain, {Gullu Mual}, with a nickel deposit; the dispute over its land and mining in 2013 is called {Gullu vai}) (r:zd:22595/zd:20889) (q:draft, low confidence)
gulmat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/work) (w:snake catching) (d:<gul>, snake, and <mat>, catch, written as one word: the catching of snakes; {gulmat siam} is skilled at catching snakes) (j:gul/mat) (r:zd:11889/zd:18154/zd:12854) (q:draft)
gulpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:nature) (w:the snake) (d:<gul> and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: the snake, as for the snake) (j:gul/pen) (r:zd:11889/zd:19831/zd:17446) (q:draft)
gundung = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/travel) (w:river/river course/length of a river) (d:<gun>, river, with <dung>, length: the course of a river along its length, and the land along it; a river name stands before it) (j:gun/dung) (r:zd:14869/zd:20494) (q:draft)
Gunkhawm = (i:1) (t:name) (c:river) (f:travel/nature) (w:Chindwin/Chindwin River) (d:the Chindwin, the great river east of the Chin Hills that joins the Irrawaddy) (r:zd:24227/zd:25221) (q:draft, low confidence)
gunlei = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:bridge) (d:a bridge over a river) (r:zd:21458/zd:15963/zd:22658) (q:draft)
gup ngah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:be saved/receive salvation) (d:<gup>, save, and <ngah>, receive: receive salvation in the Christian sense; {gup ngah mi} is a saved person and {gup ngah nading} is in order to be saved) (r:zd:21939/zd:24503) (q:draft)
gupna kitan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:lose salvation/salvation is cut off) (d:<gupna>, salvation, and <kitan>, be broken off: of a believer, that salvation once received is lost; mostly in the question whether this can happen, with <thei> or <lo> after it) (r:zd:24204) (q:draft, low confidence)
gupna ngah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:be saved/receive salvation) (d:<gupna>, salvation, and <ngah>, receive: be saved, the usual Christian expression; {gupna ngah thak} is newly saved and {gupna ngah nading} is in order to be saved) (r:zd:25571/zd:17197) (q:draft)
guta damiah = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:thieves and robbers/robbers/criminals) (d:<guta>, thief, and <damiah>, robber, said together as one word for those who steal and rob, and for theft and robbery as a danger; {guta damiah te} are the robbers) (r:zd:15056/zd:15477) (q:draft)
