guza = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:poison/toxin) (d:a substance that kills or harms when it is taken in or touches the body) (r:zd:11860/zd:11485) (q:draft)
Gym = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/media) (w:gym/fitness centre) (d:a place with equipment for physical training; {gym kimawl} is work out at the gym) (o:English) (r:zd:23758/zd:23843) (q:draft)
ha siavuan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/work) (w:dentist) (d:<ha>, tooth, and <siavuan>, doctor: a dentist; other specialists are named the same way, with the part of the body before <siavuan>) (r:zd:19363/zd:16878) (q:draft)
haa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body) (w:tooth/teeth) (d:the word <ha>, tooth, written with a long vowel; {haa nat} is toothache and {haa nawtna} is brushing the teeth) (j:ha) (r:ts:3280/zd:22650) (q:draft)
haa = (i:2) (t:intj) (f:everyday) (w:ah/oh) (d:exclamation at the end of a line in songs and laments, adding feeling to what was said) (r:zd:17565/zd:17499) (q:draft, low confidence)
haat = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/body) (j:hat) (r:zd:25790/zd:22364/zd:9438) (q:draft)
