interview = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/social) (w:interview) (d:a formal meeting in which a person is questioned, in the articles mostly by a refugee or immigration office; also used as a verb) (o:English) (r:zd:13066/zd:21598/zd:20577) (q:draft)
inu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:our mother) (d:<i> and <nu> written as one word: our mother, our mothers) (j:i/nu) (r:zd:19203/zd:25768) (q:draft)
inuntakna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:our life) (d:<i>, our, and <nuntakna>, life, written as one word) (j:i/nuntakna) (r:zd:12214/zd:23780) (q:draft)
