investment = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:investment) (d:money put into a business or project in order to gain from it) (o:English) (r:zd:25919/zd:21099) (q:draft)
inzong = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:also/too) (d:the subject marker <in> and <zong>, also, written as one word after the one who acts: he too, that one as well) (j:in/zong) (r:zd:25919/zd:20936) (q:draft)
