ipate = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (w:our fathers/our forefathers) (d:<i>, our, and <pate>, fathers, written as one word; {ipu ipate} is our ancestors) (j:i/pate) (r:zd:23554/zd:14930) (q:draft)
