isak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:we consider/we regard as/we find) (d:<i>, we, written together with <sak>, the form of <sa>, deem or feel: what we deem to be so, as in {thupi isak}, what we count important) (j:i/sak) (r:zd:17000/zd:20979/zd:21701) (q:draft)
