Italian = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:politics/media) (w:Italian) (d:of <Italy> or its people, in the English form, placed before a noun: {Italian gammi} is a citizen of Italy) (o:English) (r:zd:19648/zd:12192) (q:draft)
