Java = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Java) (d:the most populous island of Indonesia, divided into provinces such as East Java and West Java) (r:zd:17689/zd:16352) (q:draft)
Jeep = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:jeep) (d:a jeep, a small strong motor vehicle for rough roads, the usual passenger vehicle on the hill roads) (o:English) (r:zd:24574/zd:15947) (q:draft)
