ka = (i:1) (t:det) (f:everyday) (w:my) (d:first person singular possessive placed before a noun)
kaal = (i:1) (t:n) (f:time) (w:week) (d:a week of seven days; {kaal khat} is one week and {kaal nihna} the second week) (s:nipikal) (r:zd:19065/zd:20959) (q:draft)
kaal = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/time) (w:between/interval/meantime) (d:the space or time between: after two people, what is between them, as <nupa kaal>, between husband and wife; after a verb with <in>, while, as {theih loh kaal-in}, while one does not know) (s:kikal) (r:zd:21293/zd:24056/zd:21673) (q:draft)
kaamphatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:good luck/good fortune/luck) (d:<kaam>, luck, with <phatna>, here being good: good fortune; {kaamphatna tawh} is luckily) (b:kaam) (r:zd:21110/zd:22983) (q:draft)
