kaamsiatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:misfortune/bad luck/mishap) (d:<kaam>, luck, with <siatna>, badness: bad luck; {kaamsiatna tawh} is by misfortune, unluckily) (r:zd:21869/zd:24086) (q:draft)
