kabawl = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I do/I make/we hold) (d:<ka> and <bawl> written as one word: I make or do, and with <uh> we make or do; said also of holding an event, a check or a survey) (j:ka/bawl) (r:zd:25616/zd:25937) (q:draft)
Kachin = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people/land) (f:politics) (w:Kachin) (d:a people of Myanmar and their land, {Kachin State} or {Kachin gam}, in the north of the country) (r:zd:17760/zd:22391/zd:19219) (q:draft)
kaci = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I say/I said) (d:<ka> and <ci> written as one word: I say or I said, closing the words the writer quotes from himself; with <uh>, we say) (j:ka/ci) (r:zd:20391/zd:21182/zd:23437) (q:draft)
kaciah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:travel/everyday) (w:I return/I go home/we go back) (d:<ka> and <ciah> written as one word: I return, I go home; with <uh>, we return) (j:ka/ciah) (r:zd:20911/zd:17426/zd:12487) (q:draft)
kacih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I say/I said) (d:<ka> and <cih> written as one word: I say, what I said or thought; {kacih leh} is when I said or wondered) (j:ka/cih) (r:zd:21421/zd:22584) (q:draft)
kacihleh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:when I said) (d:<ka>, <cih> and <leh> written as one word after the words quoted: when I said, asked or thought so) (j:ka/cih/leh) (r:zd:13009/zd:23112) (q:draft)
kadah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:I am sad/I grieve) (d:<ka> and <dah> written as one word: I am sad, I grieve; with <uh>, we grieve) (j:ka/dah) (r:zd:24678/zd:25572/zd:25173) (q:draft)
kadeih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I want/I wish) (d:<ka>, first person, and <deih>, want, written as one word: I want, we want with <uh>, or what I want) (j:ka/deih) (r:zd:19308/zd:22911/zd:24420) (q:draft)
kagen = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I say/I tell/I speak of) (d:<ka> and <gen> written as one word: I say, we say with <uh>, or what I am speaking of) (j:ka/gen) (r:zd:16204/zd:24594/zd:12402) (q:draft)
kah = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:climb/go up/ascend) (d:go up onto a hill, a wall, a ladder or a boat) (s:kahto/paito) (a:kumsuk/paisuk/kahsuk) (q:draft)
kahding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education/social) (w:to attend/will attend) (d:<kah>, go up to, here attend a school, a meeting or a course, with <ding>, will, written as one word: who is to attend, in order to attend) (j:kah/ding) (r:zd:12168/zd:21266/zd:12618) (q:draft)
kahi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I am/we are) (d:<ka> and <hi> written as one word: I am; with <uh>, we are) (j:ka/hi) (r:zd:20911/zd:16506) (q:draft)
kahiam = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:am I) (d:<ka> and <hiam> written as one word at the end of a question the speaker asks about himself: am I, should I; {kei kua kahiam} is who am I) (j:ka/hiam) (r:zd:19309/zd:9423) (q:draft)
kahih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I am) (d:<ka> and <hih> written as one word, where it is the form of <hi>, be, used before words such as <manin>, <hang> and <pen>: that I am, my being) (j:ka/hih) (r:zd:24165/zd:23797) (q:draft)
kahih = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I do) (d:<ka> and <hih>, do, written as one word: I do, what I do) (j:ka/hih) (r:zd:24370) (q:draft, low confidence)
kahihi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I am) (d:<ka> and <hi> followed by the sentence ending, all written as one word: I am, at the end of a sentence in which the speaker says who or what he is) (j:ka/hi) (r:zd:19472/zd:12980) (q:draft)
kahihman = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:because I am/since I am) (d:{ka hih man} written as one word: <ka>, I, with <hih>, the form of <hi>, be, as in <ahih>, and <man>, because, as in <manin>; it closes a clause that gives the reason, often followed by <in>) (j:ka/hih/man) (r:zd:22592/zd:22658/zd:10973) (q:draft)
kahihmanin = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:because I am/since I am) (d:<ka>, I, with <hih>, the form of <hi>, be, and <manin>, because, written as one word: because I am or was) (j:ka/hih/manin) (r:zd:23797/zd:24059) (q:draft)
kahihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:my being/that I am) (d:<ka> and <hihna> written as one word: the fact that I am, or with <uh> that we are, what goes before; {Zomi kahihna} is my being a Zomi) (j:ka/hihna) (r:zd:21326/zd:21090) (q:draft)
kahlai = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education) (w:be still attending/while attending) (d:<kah> in the sense attend a school, with <lai> in the sense still, while, written as one word: be still at school or college, while attending) (j:kah/lai) (r:zd:12470/zd:23443) (q:draft)
