kal masa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/time) (w:first step/first week) (d:<kal>, a step or a week, and <masa>, first: the first step, mostly in the figurative sense of the first thing done toward an aim; after the name of a month, the first week of that month) (r:zd:21796/zd:26945/zd:21176) (q:draft)
Kaladan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:river) (f:travel/nature) (w:Kaladan) (d:a river that flows from Mizoram through Paletwa in Chin State to Sittwe in Rakhine State) (r:zd:20041/zd:17826) (q:draft)
kalawm = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:my friend) (d:<ka>, my, and <lawm>, friend, written as one word: my friend; {kalawm te} is my friends and {kalawm kagual} my friends and companions) (j:ka/lawm) (r:zd:16241/zd:24574/zd:13314) (q:draft)
