kamai = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:body/everyday) (w:my face/before me) (d:<ka> and <mai> written as one word: my face; {kamai ah} is in front of me, and {kamai nawt} is I press forward) (j:ka/mai) (r:zd:13328/zd:19783/zd:13072) (q:draft)
