kamkup = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:discuss/converse/talk together) (d:<kam> word with <kup>, talk over: talk with one another about a matter; also as a noun, a discussion, and {kamkup pih} is someone to talk with) (s:kikup) (r:zd:22715/zd:24217/zd:11809) (q:draft)
kamkupna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:discussion/talks/dialogue/consultation) (d:<kam>, word, with <kikupna>, talking a matter over: a discussion or meeting for talks, also talks between opposing sides) (s:kikupna) (r:zd:24217/zd:26620/zd:15011) (q:draft)
kamlet = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/work) (w:interpreter/translator/interpreting) (d:one who puts the speech of one language into another, and the work of doing so; also used as a verb, interpret) (s:kamphen) (r:zd:24531/zd:13165) (q:draft)
kammal = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/everyday) (w:word/speech) (d:<kam>, mouth, with <mal>, a single unit: a word, a thing said) (s:kamgen) (r:21.12.10) (q:draft)
