kamtawh = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:by mouth/in words/verbally) (d:<kam>, mouth, and <tawh>, with, written as one word: with the mouth, in spoken words, often set against what is done or thought) (j:kam/tawh) (r:zd:23479/zd:20568/zd:20725) (q:draft)
