kanbeh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education/everyday) (w:research further/inquire further/look into more) (d:<kan>, search or look into, with <beh>, here more, in addition: look further into a matter, find out more about it) (j:kan/beh) (r:zd:20169/zd:24022) (q:draft)
