kata = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:my child/my son/my daughter) (d:<ka>, my, and <ta>, child, written as one word; {kazi kata} is my wife and my children) (j:ka/ta) (r:zd:25572/zd:15255/zd:23773) (q:draft)
