mei = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/nature) (w:fire) (d:fire, the flame that burns; also a lamp or light, and the first part of many words such as <meikuang>, flame, and <meikhu>, smoke) (s:meikuang) (r:3.9.11) (q:draft)
meigong = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (w:widow) (d:a woman whose husband has died, also said as {meigong numei}; often named together with {pa nei lote}, the fatherless) (s:meigongnu) (r:42.21.2)
meikai = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:mist/fog/low cloud) (d:mist or cloud that hangs low and hides the view; {guahzu meikai nuai} is under rain and mist; also said of something too hazy to understand) (r:zd:21991/zd:17733/zd:14824) (q:draft, low confidence)
meikanggawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/everyday) (w:burn down/be destroyed by fire/be badly burned) (d:<meikang>, here catch fire and burn, and <gawp>, severely, written as one word: be burned down or badly burned; common in news headlines) (j:meikang/gawp) (r:zd:11148/zd:13316/zd:14692) (q:draft)
meikangtum = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/home) (w:burn down/be destroyed by fire) (d:<mei>, fire, and <kangtum>, burn up, written as one word: be completely burnt by fire) (j:mei/kangtum) (r:zd:12761/zd:13161/zd:17800) (q:draft)
meikhau = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/it) (w:electric wire/power line/cable) (d:a wire or cable that carries electricity, from <mei>, fire or light, and <khau>, cord) (r:zd:15677/zd:17175/zd:13264) (q:draft)
meikuang akipan = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:media) (w:fire broke out/a fire started) (d:<meikuang>, flame, with {a kipan}, it began, written as one word: a fire broke out, the set wording of a news report; the place stands before it with <ah> or <panin>, and <akipan> is here the verb and not the marker from or since) (r:zd:15461/zd:17729) (q:draft)
meikuanggawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:burst into flames/burn up/be burnt out) (d:<meikuang> and <gawp> written as one word: catch fire and burn fiercely, to the point of ruin; said of vehicles and houses) (j:meikuang/gawp) (r:zd:19157/zd:18911/zd:13324) (q:draft)
meikuangpen = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/nature) (w:the fire/the blaze) (d:<meikuang>, fire, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: the fire, as the thing spoken about) (j:meikuang/pen) (r:zd:20369/zd:11606/zd:15410) (q:draft)
meileeng = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:train/railway train) (d:<mei>, fire, with <leeng>: a railway train; {meileeng lampi} is a railway) (r:zd:10952/zd:18147/zd:23653) (q:draft)
