meimai = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/nature) (w:dimly/hazily/blankly) (d:placed after a verb or describing word: dim, dark or hazy, of cloud, smoke, darkness or a clouded head; of people, as in {om meimai} and {tu meimai}, be or sit there blankly, doing nothing) (r:zd:22658/zd:19676) (q:draft, low confidence)
