muhkholhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/work) (w:vision/foresight/anticipation) (d:<muh>, see, with <kholhna>, doing beforehand, written as one word: seeing ahead what is to come and what should be aimed at) (j:muh/kholhna) (r:zd:20971/zd:24673) (q:draft)
muhkhop = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/politics) (w:meet together/meet) (d:<muh>, see, and <khop>, together, written as one word; with <ki>, {ki muhkhop}, meet each other, hold a meeting) (j:muh/khop) (r:zd:12680/zd:19820/zd:17915) (q:draft)
muhkhopna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:meeting) (d:written after the prefix <ki>, {ki muhkhopna}: a meeting, a coming together of people or groups to see and talk with one another) (s:kikhopna) (r:zd:20507/zd:15463) (q:draft)
muhloh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:not see/unseen) (d:<muh> and <loh> written as one word: not seeing, not seen; {mi muhloh nading mun} is a place where people will not see) (j:muh/loh) (r:zd:15653/zd:20860/zd:20627) (q:draft)
muhlohna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:not seeing/out of sight) (d:<muh>, see, with <lohna>, the not doing: what one does not see or where one is not seen; {mite muhlohna ah} is where people do not see, out of sight) (j:muh/lohna) (r:zd:21085/zd:11831/zd:20997) (q:draft)
muhpih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:see together with/help to see/help to find) (d:<muh> and <pih> written as one word: see something along with someone, or see or find it for someone, help someone to get it) (j:muh/pih) (r:zd:23022/zd:16457/zd:22646) (q:draft, low confidence)
muhtheihloh = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/religion) (w:invisible/unseen) (d:<muhtheih> can be seen and the negative <loh> written as one word, placed before a noun: that cannot be seen) (j:muhtheih/loh) (r:zd:22429/zd:24320/zd:22695) (q:draft)
muhzia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:view/point of view/way of seeing) (d:<muh>, see, with <zia>, manner: how someone sees or understands a matter) (r:zd:22683/zd:22023/zd:9428) (q:draft)
muibut = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work/everyday) (w:be effective/be productive/flourish) (d:do well and bring results in what one does, make good progress) (r:zd:17177/zd:20516) (q:draft, low confidence)
mukhalo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:not see/fail to see/not notice) (d:<mukha>, happen to see, with <lo>, not: not get to see, fail to notice someone or something) (j:mukha/lo) (r:zd:14726/zd:25937) (q:draft)
mukhiata = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:have found/be found) (d:<mukhia>, find, with the ending <ta>, now or already, written as one word; mostly as {ki mukhiata}, has been found) (j:mukhia/ta) (r:zd:13102/zd:16990) (q:draft)
mukhiazo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:be able to find/manage to find) (d:<mukhia>, find, and <zo>, manage to, written as one word; often after <ki> and with a negative: have not been able to find someone or something) (j:mukhia/zo) (r:zd:17645/zd:16145/zd:11588) (q:draft)
mukpau = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:speech/words/way of speaking) (d:<muk>, lips, with <pau>, speech: what a person says and how; used as a pair with <kampau>) (s:kampau) (r:zd:16227/zd:19676/zd:23975) (q:draft)
muktuam = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:face mask/mask) (d:a covering worn over the mouth and nose; <muk>, mouth, with <tuam>, cover. The same word is used as a verb, cover the mouth) (r:zd:23649/zd:23935/zd:24657) (q:draft)
mulo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/body) (w:not see/not find) (d:<mu> and <lo> written as one word: not see, not notice or not regard; {mit khua mulo} is blind) (j:mu/lo) (r:zd:24026/zd:20588/zd:15890) (q:draft)
