munnih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/travel) (w:two places) (d:<mun>, place, and <nih>, two, written as one word: two places, mostly as {munnih ah}, in two places) (j:mun/nih) (r:zd:15260/zd:12689/zd:13255) (q:draft)
