nitak lamin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:in the evening/at evening time) (d:<nitak>, evening, with <lam>, side or part, and the marker <in>, the same as <nitaklam> with <in>; here <lamin> is not the verb build: in the evening, placed after a date or a word such as <zanni>, yesterday, or <tua>, that) (s:nitaklam) (r:zd:23539/ts:3882) (q:draft)
