paikul = (i:1) (t:v) (f:travel/everyday) (w:must go/have to go) (d:<pai>, go, and <kul>, must, written as one word: it is necessary to go) (j:pai/kul) (r:zd:14927/zd:11775/zd:16216) (q:draft)
pailo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:not go/not come) (d:<pai> and <lo> written as one word: does not go, did not come) (j:pai/lo) (r:zd:23935/ts:2731/zd:22877) (q:draft)
