pataugawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:panic/be greatly alarmed/be thrown into alarm) (d:<patau>, be alarmed, and <gawp>, severely, written as one word: be in great alarm, panic) (s:patau) (j:patau/gawp) (r:zd:15489/zd:16137/zd:11660) (q:draft)
patauman = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:panic/be alarmed/be thrown into a fright) (d:<patau> be alarmed, with <man>; mostly as {ki patauman}: people take fright, there is alarm or panic) (b:patau) (r:zd:11897/zd:20013/zd:19991) (q:draft, low confidence)
patcil = (i:1) (t:n) (f:time/everyday) (w:beginning/start/first) (d:<pat>, begin, and <cil>, at first, written as one word, after <ki>: {a ki patcil} is when it first began, the beginning, and {a ki patcil in} is at first, in the beginning) (j:pat/cil) (r:zd:19166/zd:20803/zd:15280) (q:draft)
