pawlkhatpen = (i:1) (t:pron) (f:everyday) (w:some/some of them) (d:<pawlkhat>, some, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: as for some of them) (j:pawlkhat/pen) (r:zd:17974/zd:16937) (q:draft)
pawlkhatzong = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:some also/some as well) (d:<pawlkhat> and <zong> written as one word: some of them also, placed after the noun it counts) (j:pawlkhat/zong) (r:zd:11625/zd:15370/zd:25221) (q:draft)
pawlkhawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/politics) (w:join together/unite/team up) (d:<pawl> and <khawm> written as one word, used with the prefix <ki>: {ki pawlkhawm} is form one group, join with others; the partner is marked by <tawh>) (j:pawl/khawm) (r:zd:20250/zd:19220/zd:16442) (q:draft)
