pawlpi kem = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion) (w:pastor/church minister) (d:<pawlpi>, church, and <kem>, look after: the one who looks after a congregation, its pastor; mostly as {pawlpi kem sia} or before the title and name of the pastor, and also as a verb, look after a church) (s:Pastor) (r:zd:23205/zd:25080) (q:draft)
