pazong = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:the man too/he also) (d:<pa>, the man, and <zong>, also, written as one word after a noun that names a man: that man too, as in {Driver pazong}, the driver also) (j:pa/zong) (r:zd:20164/zd:23843) (q:draft)
