peuhleh = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:as long as/provided that/whenever) (d:<peuh> and <leh>, if, written as one word after a verb: if only, as long as, whenever that is so) (j:peuh/leh) (r:zd:22095/zd:21605/zd:19166) (q:draft)
