rights = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:rights/right) (d:what a person is entitled to by law or as a human being, mostly in human rights; the English plural form is used as the word) (o:English) (r:zd:16452/zd:11918/zd:20930) (q:draft)
