sahdah = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/everyday) (w:chewing tobacco) (d:tobacco that is held in the mouth or chewed, named beside cigarettes, <khaini> and <kunza> among harmful habits) (r:zd:17635/zd:16398) (q:draft)
saihapaak = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/work) (w:ivory/elephant tusk) (d:<saiha>, elephant tusk, with <paak>: ivory as a traded and smuggled good; what <paak> adds here is not certain) (s:saiha) (r:zd:13278/zd:10759) (q:draft, low confidence)
