sathei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/everyday) (w:can sing/able to sing) (d:<sa> in its sense sing, as in {la sa}, sing a song, and <thei>, can, written as one word: be able to sing) (j:sa/thei) (r:zd:25318/zd:14767) (q:draft)
satsakgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:batter/smash up/hack) (d:<satsak> and <gawp> written as one word: strike or hack something that belongs to another again and again or with great force, so that it is badly damaged or hurt) (j:satsak/gawp) (r:zd:19562/zd:15366) (q:draft)
satui = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food) (w:soup/broth) (d:<sa>, meat, with <tui>, water: the liquid in which meat was boiled) (s:mehtui) (q:draft)
