sawtnailo = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:time) (w:not long/recent) (d:<sawt> long and <nailo> not yet, written as one word: it is not long since, a short time ago) (j:sawt/nailo) (r:zd:12048/zd:12482/zd:12504) (q:draft)
sawtpipek = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:very long ago/a long time ago) (d:<sawtpi>, for a long time, and <pek>, far back, written as one word; {abeisa sawtpipek akipan} is since long ago) (j:sawtpi/pek) (r:zd:13089/zd:19569) (q:draft)
