sedah = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:do not) (d:placed after a verb and followed by <in>, <un> or <ni>: do not, let us not, often with the sense do not go and do it needlessly; {gen sedah in} is do not tell) (r:zd:12267/zd:25562/zd:16893) (q:draft)
