Sekan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:politics) (w:Sekan) (d:a village in Myanmar named in reports of fighting; the sentences do not say where it lies) (r:ts:4572) (q:draft, low confidence)
Selangor = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel) (w:Selangor) (d:a state of Malaysia that surrounds Kuala Lumpur, often written in addresses) (r:zd:19581/zd:18074) (q:draft)
