selection = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/education) (w:selection) (d:the choosing of people for a team, a contest or an award) (o:English) (r:zd:20145/zd:16216) (q:draft, low confidence)
Selfie = (i:1) (t:n) (f:it/media) (w:selfie) (d:a photograph that a person takes of himself with a phone; {Selfie kizaih} is take a selfie) (o:English) (r:zd:11967/zd:24276) (q:draft)
selo = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:not really/not particularly) (d:the emphatic <se> and <lo>, not, written as one word after a verb: not really, not in any particular way; {kul selo} is not really needed) (j:se/lo) (r:zd:25250/zd:21260/zd:21042) (q:draft)
sem = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:work/operate/perform/serve/do) (d:do work or carry out a task; {na sem} is do work, and with a person named before it, serve that person) (a:tawlnga) (r:18.5.9)
