sorry = (i:1) (t:intj) (f:everyday/social) (w:sorry) (d:English word of apology used in Zolai speech and writing; {sorry ci} is say sorry) (o:English) (r:zd:21113/zd:11852) (q:draft)
Soviet = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics) (w:Soviet Union/Soviet) (d:the Soviet Union, the communist state of Russia and its neighbours from 1922 to 1991, also written {Soviet Union}; {Soviet te} is the Soviets) (r:zd:10857/zd:20043) (q:draft)
