sponsor = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work/social) (w:sponsor) (d:pay for or support an event, a project or a person, also stand as sponsor for a refugee; used as a noun too, a sponsor) (o:English) (r:zd:21170/zd:22203) (q:draft)
Sport = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:sport/sports) (d:games and physical contests; mostly in English compounds such as {Sport Committee} and {Sport Complex}) (s:kimawlna) (o:English) (r:zd:24119/zd:23048) (q:draft, low confidence)
