standard = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/work) (w:standard) (d:a level of quality or a measure against which things are judged; {standard tawh en} is look at something by a standard) (o:English) (r:zd:17335/zd:24199) (q:draft)
Starbucks = (i:1) (t:name) (f:food/work) (w:Starbucks) (d:an American company with coffee shops in many countries) (r:zd:19648/zd:19829) (q:draft)
