suhkhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics) (w:seize/take by force/overthrow) (d:<suh>, take by force, with <khiat>, away: take something from its holder by force; {ukna suhkhiat} is seize power, said of a military coup) (r:ts:5339/zd:25063/zd:24966) (q:draft)
