suhsawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:try to rob/attempt to snatch) (d:<suh>, take by force, with <sawm>, intend or try, written as one word: try to rob someone of something) (j:suh/sawm) (r:zd:12072/zd:21588) (q:draft)
