suihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:kicking/playing football) (d:the kicking of a ball, almost always in {bawlung suihna}, the playing of football; the noun of <sui> in its sense strike with the foot) (r:zd:16379/zd:23653) (q:draft)
