suksia = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:do harm/be badly affected/get worse) (d:harm or be harmed badly, grow worse; {a suksia pen} is the one worst affected; compare <susia>, destroy) (r:zd:24469/zd:24271/zd:19662) (q:draft, low confidence)
