sutuah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:set against each other/stir up conflict/incite) (d:<su>, touch, with <tuah>, bring together: make people clash with one another, stir up a quarrel between them; {ki sutuah} is clash with each other) (r:zd:22586/zd:19150/ts:9808) (q:draft)
