telkhialhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:misunderstanding/misconception) (d:<tel>, understand, with <khialh>, wrongly, and the noun suffix {-na}: a wrong understanding of something; {ki telkhialhna} is misunderstanding between people) (r:zd:22171/zd:15498) (q:draft)
