uipi = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (f:nature/home) (w:female dog/bitch/mother dog) (d:<ui>, dog, with the ending {-pi}, female or full-grown: a female dog, a dog that has pups; in stories also a big dog) (b:ui) (r:zd:19295/zd:15283) (q:draft)
uipil = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (f:nature/work) (w:trained dog/sniffer dog/police dog) (d:<ui>, dog, with <pil>, clever: a clever or trained dog, in news mostly one used by police or customs to search) (r:zd:11792/zd:21291/zd:15344) (q:draft)
