Vietnamese = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:politics/travel) (w:Vietnamese) (d:of Vietnam, a person from Vietnam; placed before a noun as in {Vietnamese numei}, a Vietnamese woman) (o:English) (r:zd:12891/zd:21649) (q:draft)
view = (i:1) (t:n) (f:it/media) (w:view) (d:one viewing of a video or post on the internet, as counted by the site) (o:English) (r:zd:19151/zd:12555) (q:draft)
