vom = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:black/dark) (d:black or dark in colour, said of horses, hair, skin and the sky) (a:kang/paak) (q:draft)
von = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:child/offspring) (d:word of songs and poetry for a child; {sawn leh von} is children and descendants; also in names of family associations) (r:zd:24168/zd:22413) (q:draft, low confidence)
