vote pia = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics) (w:vote/cast a vote/vote for) (d:<vote>, vote, with <pia>, give: vote in an election; the one voted for stands before it without a marker) (r:zd:24563/zd:24370/zd:23742) (q:draft)
