zongh = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (j:zong) (r:zd:22429/zd:21817/zd:11456) (q:draft)
zongin = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:although/but/yet/even if) (d:<zong>, also or even, with <in>: after a verb, although or even if; {ahi zongin} at the start of a clause is but or yet, and after each of several nouns it is whether or) (s:napi/hinapi)
zongkawikawi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:search around/look everywhere for/search high and low) (d:<zong>, look for, with <kawikawi>, here and there, written as one word: go about searching in many places) (j:zong/kawikawi) (r:zd:18161/zd:14931/zd:26495) (q:draft)
zongpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:also/too) (d:<zong> and <pen> written as one word after a noun or phrase: this one also, as the topic of the sentence) (j:zong/pen) (r:zd:12468/zd:15994/zd:18112) (q:draft)
zongsat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:be accustomed to/make a habit of/be addicted to) (d:do something so regularly that it becomes a habit, good or bad; {zongsat na} is a habit or an addiction) (r:zd:20963/zd:19455/zd:25909) (q:draft)
zonsan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:search for/hunt for/pursue) (d:of the police, to be looking for a person in order to catch him; {aki zonsan} is one who is wanted) (r:zd:15451/zd:16998) (q:draft)
Zonu = (i:1) (t:name) (f:social/media) (w:Zo woman) (d:<zo>, Zomi, with <nu>, woman or mother; in the articles almost only in {Zonu Tongluan}, the name of a Zomi women's magazine) (r:zd:21066/zd:16235) (q:draft, low confidence)
Zonuamzang = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:travel) (w:Zonuamzang) (d:a Zomi village in Myanmar, named together with Kawlpi; written after a personal name it tells the home village of the person) (r:zd:23258) (q:draft)
zonzia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/work) (w:way of seeking/way of earning) (d:<zon>, seek, with <zia>, manner: how something is looked for or earned; {sum zonzia} is the way of earning money) (b:zon) (r:zd:19676/zd:15268) (q:draft)
Zoo = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/travel) (w:zoo) (d:a place where wild animals are kept for people to see; in Zolai <ganhing khawina>) (o:English) (r:zd:11044/zd:12869) (q:draft)
Zoom = (i:1) (t:name) (f:it) (w:Zoom) (d:the Zoom video meeting application, used for meetings and services held online) (r:zd:25178/zd:25182) (q:draft)
zopan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/time) (w:manage at last/finally be able to) (d:<zo>, be able, with <pan>, only then, written as one word after a verb: only at that point succeed in doing it) (j:zo/pan) (r:zd:11148/zd:19408/zd:24318) (q:draft)
Zopau = (i:1) (t:name) (f:social/education) (w:Zo language/Zomi language) (d:the language spoken by the Zomi; {Zo} with <pau>, language) (s:Zokam) (r:zd:13252/zd:22833/zd:14910) (q:draft)
Zophei = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:social) (w:Zophei) (d:a Chin people and their area in Chin State, Myanmar, named beside Zotung and Zokhua) (r:zd:17782/zd:13181) (q:draft)
Zopuan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/social) (w:Zomi traditional cloth/Zomi traditional dress) (d:the traditional woven cloth and dress of the Zomi, from {Zo} and <puan>, cloth; {Zopuan silh} is wear it) (r:zd:17804/zd:25562/zd:20080) (q:draft)
