zua = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:father) (d:poetic word for father, used in songs and paired with the word for mother in {tun leh zua}, mother and father) (s:pa) (r:zd:24854) (q:draft)
zuah = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/media) (d:with a burst, without restraint: of growth or singing, bursting out strongly; {zuah thu} is a statement put out without ground) (r:ts:4005/ts:1264/zd:22584) (q:draft, low confidence)
