zuandingin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:travel) (w:bound for/heading for/on the way to) (d:<zuan>, head for, with <dingin>, in order to, written as one word after the name of a place: in order to go there, bound for it) (j:zuan/dingin) (r:zd:20229/zd:19495/zd:12906) (q:draft)
