zuihloh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:not follow/not obey) (d:<zuih> and <loh> written as one word: not following, not keeping; {zuihloh phamawh} is it must be followed) (j:zuih/loh) (r:zd:21989/zd:17383/zd:17444) (q:draft)
